   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div> Hi all,</div><div>I have 2 questions:</div><div>1.Do I need to calculate ECV,PUC before fitting bifactor model?</div><div>2.If yes, which function can be used?<br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "rOsC-8bTCQAJ",
   "from": "Carlos Ossio",
   "author": "af8b3df1f270185a",
   "date": "2020-07-09T02:28:01Z",
   "subject": "Re: Is there any function can be used to calculate ECV,PUC of bifactor model?",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">As I understand it, you can calculate EVC and PUC after you fit the bifactor model (as the difference between the factor loadings between the unidimensional model and the bifactor model is what is used by the computation).<div><br></div><div>Use BifactorIndicesCalculator package in R.</div><div><br></div><div>Also see: <span dir=\"auto\" style=\"background:rgb(249,249,249);color:rgb(3,3,3);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\">The Bifactor Indices Calculator by Michael Toland is available from </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fuknowledge.uky.edu%2Fedp_tools%2F1%2F&amp;redir_token=HEZaikiV3AD66hocirte1ca3KZJ8MTU5NDMzNjQ2MEAxNTk0MjUwMDYw&amp;event=video_description&amp;v=8E3S_rVofV0\" rel=\"nofollow\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:var(--yt-endpoint-text-regular-decoration,none);color:var(--yt-endpoint-visited-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action));font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(249,249,249)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fuknowledge.uky.edu%252Fedp_tools%252F1%252F%26redir_token%3DHEZaikiV3AD66hocirte1ca3KZJ8MTU5NDMzNjQ2MEAxNTk0MjUwMDYw%26event%3Dvideo_description%26v%3D8E3S_rVofV0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792472212551000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3XUfXuBFuszX17DrbZ5G8p\">https://uknowledge.uky.edu/edp_tools/1/</a><span dir=\"auto\" style=\"background:rgb(249,249,249);color:rgb(3,3,3);font-family:Roboto,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;white-space:pre-wrap\"> (Citation: </span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?q=https%3A%2F%2Fdoi.org%2F10.13023%2Fedp.tool.01&amp;redir_token=HEZaikiV3AD66hocirte1ca3KZJ8MTU5NDMzNjQ2MEAxNTk0MjUwMDYw&amp;event=video_description&amp;v=8E3S_rVofV0\" rel=\"nofollow\" dir=\"auto\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:var(--yt-endpoint-text-regular-decora